<title>USA: TABLE-Herman Miller Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Herman Miller Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ZEELAND, Mich. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in 000s, except per share data)</p>
<p> Three Months Ended     May 31, 1997	 June 1, 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			    $411,204	  $341,535</p>
<p> Restructuring/Other	    (4,736)(a)		  --</p>
<p> Net Income			  27,425(a)	    17,077</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share		 .58(a)		 .34</p>
<p> Common Share Equivalents     47,481,015	49,987,656</p>
<p>(a) Pre-tax loss on the sale of German manufacturing operations was $4.7 million less than recorded in FY 97 Q3. Income tax provision includes $5.2 million reduction in expected tax benefits from the disposal. Net income in Q4 was reduced $500,000, or $.01 per share.</p>
<p> Fiscal Year Ended	     May 31, 1997	 June 1, 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			  $1,495,885    $1,283,931</p>
<p> Restructuring/Other		   14,500(a)	  16,515(b)</p>
<p> Net Income				74,398(a)	  45,946(b)</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share		    1.55(a)	     .91(b)</p>
<p> Common Share Equivalents     48,062,100    50,257,470</p>
<p>(a) Includes $14.5 million pretax loss on sale of German operations, which decreased net income by $10.4 million, or $.22 per share.</p>
<p>(b) Includes $16.5 million pretax litigation settlements which decreased net income by $10.6 million, or $.21 per share.</p>
</text>
